@startuml
title Story 3 — Name search
actor User
participant "Browser UI" as UI
participant "app.js" as JS
participant "Names API\n/ api/names/search" as NamesAPI
participant "IBGE (Nomes)" as IBGE
User -> UI: type name + press search
UI -> JS: doSearch()
JS -> NamesAPI: GET /api/names/search?name=Maria&state=BR
NamesAPI -> IBGE: (optional) call IBGE names endpoint
IBGE --> NamesAPI: name frequency
NamesAPI --> JS: 200 {name,total,frequency}
JS -> UI: render result (no reload)
@enduml
